1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,553
Only have a week off?

2
00:00:01,553 --> 00:00:03,767
Pick one of these 4 Caminos.

3
00:00:03,767 --> 00:00:05,144
One: the French Way

4
00:00:05,144 --> 00:00:06,321
from Sarria.

5
00:00:06,321 --> 00:00:07,211
The classic,

6
00:00:07,211 --> 00:00:08,741
